<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-BARCELONA OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BARCELONA OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the Barcelona Open on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Renzo Furlan (Italy) beat Jacobo Diaz (Spain) 6-7 (5-7) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Marc Goellner (Germany) beat 10-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 6-4 2-6 6-2</p>
<p>Joan Albert Viloca (Spain) beat Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 6-3 6-0</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Marco Gorriz (Spain) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Julian Alonso (Spain) beat 14-Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) 7-6 (8-6) 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>Carlos Costa (Spain) beat Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Alberto Martin (Spain) beat Adrian Volnea (Romania) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Fernando Vicente (Spain) beat 12-Jan Slemerink (Netherlands) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Christian Ruud (Norway) beat 13-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Don Johnson (U.S.) beat Roberto Carretero (Spain) 7-6 (7-1) 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Gilbert Schaller (Austria) beat 15-Michael Stich (Germany) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 7-5 6-4</p>
</text>
